{"title":"Werewolf Pelt","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Werewolf, Alpha Werewolf, Lycan</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - dropped it in 3,777 of 3,778 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"alpha-werewolf\" title=\"Alpha Werewolf - dropped it in 358 of 359 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fc7711ec9ecca6b88e5c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Alpha Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"lycan\" title=\"Lycan - dropped it in 102 of 103 looted corpses (1/1)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d3c73d7e69d29ade0e0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lycan</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"werewolf-pelt\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/scribing\">Scribing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/werewolfpelt-feet\">Werewolfpelt Feet</a